<html><head><title>Curriculum</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">An important consideration when developing transdisciplinary education is the question of </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">where in the curriculum</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px"> the education is embedded (Horn et al., 2021). You can choose between </span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">intra- or extracurricular</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">mandatory or elective</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">, and </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">bachelor or master</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px"> level. It’s important to take into account various factors such as educational needs, organizational possibilities, and the interests of partners.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Ideally, the decision-making process is driven by the </span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">desired outcomes for all partners</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">The </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">Practice</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"> page provides a more detailed description of these options, including the pros and cons of each.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 16px 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">Under the </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">Theory</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px"> tab, you’ll</span><span style="margin: 0px"> find an overview of the choices involved in implementing a transdisciplinary education project.</span>&nbsp;</span></p></body></html>